     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Giants Galore is the largest unit in Play Lands, covering 54'5\" x 47'1\" before the safe zone is added. An octopus figure sits among Play Red and Baby Blue towers, and striped slides radiate out from the centre along with tube slides and walkways. Children climb up, balance along the walkways, hang from the bars and pick from several slides on the way down. The age group is 3+ with key users from 3 to 12. At this size it makes a centrepiece for a large public park, township or resort lawn rather than a society corner. The safe play area is 59'5\" x 53'1\" and the listed capacity is 15. Every galvanised pipe, roto-moulded part, composite laminate and length of play rope in it is warranted for 3 years. Call us to discuss whether your ground can take it."
